Package: bouncermodels
Title: Pre-Trained Models for Cricket Analytics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pete", "Owen", email = "peteowen1@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides pre-trained machine learning models for cricket analytics,
    served via GitHub releases with local caching. Models include ball outcome
    prediction (agnostic and full), pre-match win probability, margin prediction,
    and score projection. Used by the bouncer package for match simulation and
    prediction.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
